      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 4.14,
          "en": "Another very important topic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.14,
          "end": 8.73,
          "en": "in our daily lives is summarizing information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.73,
          "end": 11.55,
          "en": "No matter if you read a blog post or an article,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.55,
          "end": 14.61,
          "en": "if you get a long email from a colleague,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 17.88,
          "en": "sometimes you only need to know the core information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.88,
          "end": 20.01,
          "en": "of a specific text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.01,
          "end": 23.943,
          "en": "With ChatGPT, we can now summarize text within seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 29.28,
          "en": "I have a very long text now here in my prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.28,
          "end": 32.31,
          "en": "This text is all about a healthy lifestyle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 34.74,
          "en": "what you should eat, what you should do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.74,
          "end": 36.573,
          "en": "how you should sleep, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.59,
          "end": 40.17,
          "en": "So instead of reading the text and then summarizing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.17,
          "end": 44.37,
          "en": "on our own, we can just provide the text to ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 49.37,
          "en": "and then simply say, summarize this text for me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.72,
          "end": 55.14,
          "en": "We don't add any further constraints in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.14,
          "end": 58.143,
          "en": "Let's just see what ChatGPT makes out of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "So this is a really very, very short summary.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 67.17,
          "en": "Let's say this is too condensed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.17,
          "end": 70.02,
          "en": "I wanna have at least the subheaders in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.02,
          "end": 75.02,
          "en": "and more core content should be remained in the summary.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 75.09,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "Then I can simply tell ChatGPT that I'm not totally happy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.36,
          "en": "with this way of summarizing the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 81.36,
          "end": 84.09,
          "en": "Let's say this is too short and unstructured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.09,
          "end": 86.03999999999999,
          "en": "so it should summarize the different topics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.03999999999999,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "in separate paragraphs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 88.89,
          "en": "It should include subheaders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.89,
          "end": 91.713,
          "en": "but of course, all core topics should be included.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 96.39,
          "en": "And now we have a obviously longer summary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.39,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "which still is a lot shorter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 102.33,
          "en": "and specifically more structured than the initial text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.33,
          "end": 105.63,
          "en": "And with that, ChatGPT made it very easy for us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.63,
          "end": 107.64,
          "en": "to summarize this text very short,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.64,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "like this one here or in the more structured version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 113.043,
          "en": "which I personally prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114,
          "end": 116.64,
          "en": "Now, besides summarizing provided texts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.64,
          "end": 120.69,
          "en": "as we did it here, you can also use ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.69,
          "end": 124.23,
          "en": "to summarize articles that you found on a website.",
