          "end": 162.32999999999998,
          "en": "that it should summarize this article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.32999999999998,
          "end": 167.32999999999998,
          "en": "and let's maybe add, keep it as short as possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.8,
          "end": 174.8,
          "en": "but don't lose important information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 178.62,
          "end": 179.553,
          "en": "So let's see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 181.47,
          "end": 183.42,
          "en": "And that's quite awesome actually, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.42,
          "end": 186.9,
          "en": "We get a very condensed summary with a short introduction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
